# The bake's working files. Both are derived and both are re-made by
# `npm run fetch`; the .ovindex costs a minute to rebuild and the .cache about
# thirty seconds. What IS committed is data/ -- Pages serves it, and a page
# with no build step has nothing to generate it at deploy time.
tools/.cache/
tools/.ovindex/
tools/__pycache__/
